Subject: [PATCH] feat: Fix Clerk CORS issue and improve middleware

This commit addresses a CORS issue with the Clerk.js script by adding a proxy rewrite rule to next.config.js.

It also replaces the existing middleware with a more robust version to prevent issues with static assets.

Finally, it includes minor formatting and content changes to schema.sql and app/instylehairboutique/page.tsx.
